OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy and dry into the
OL,7,Fevening. A cool night follows with
OL,8,Fcloud building from the west. Patchy
OL,9,Frain in the far west by dawn with
OL,10,Fwinds freshening later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy but mostly dry to
OL,13,Fstart, patchy light rain developing
OL,14,Fduring the morning and lingering
OL,15,Fthrough the day. Fresh winds.
OL,16,FTemperatures above average.
